# Context7 Auto-invocation Rules

## Always Use Context7
When the user requests any of the following, automatically use Context7:
- Code examples and generation
- Library/API documentation
- Setup and configuration steps
- Framework implementation guidance
- Dependency management
- Best practices for libraries
- Troubleshooting library issues

## Context7 Triggers
Use Context7 for:
- All external library interactions (pandas, numpy, xgboost, scikit-learn, etc.)
- Python package documentation
- Machine learning framework guidance
- Data science workflow implementation
- API integration examples
- Configuration file creation

## Project Context
This is a trading agent project using XGBoost models. Prioritize up-to-date documentation for:
- XGBoost and machine learning libraries
- Data processing frameworks
- Trading and financial libraries
- Python best practices for quantitative finance